{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0184_1000_p", "source_sha256": "dfea2c3e993120de0c32b5426a80c1313a537db9ce8df41b916b6b11d7075732", "ja": "（今日は可奈のPV撮影。監督は、凄腕だが\n指導が厳しいとの噂。しっかりケアをしないと……）", "zh": "（今天是可奈的PV拍摄。听说导演虽然本领高强，但指导也很严格。一定要好好照顾她才行……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0184_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "62b3b6e6cdf7831f62b5f4aca8501eca17ea7ac5378473db0e71f427095bf45d", "ja": "ここで……ターン！\n最後は、笑顔！", "zh": "在这里……转身！\n最后要保持笑容！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0184_1002_kantoku", "source_sha256": "02d7db8865dd8bb3daf88767d2d8668bbbc153f1fe6c68885a74ce9a6a46f200", "ja": "んー、ダメダメ！　カットよ！　振り付けと\n歌のタイミング、もっと合わせられるでしょ！", "zh": "唔——不行不行！卡！编舞和\n歌声的节奏，明明还可以配合得更好吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0184_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "3c516238d8ec5133400cfa4286b199c33c36f51887e8e05ea64ea2bd06517e50", "ja": "は、はい！　すみません！\nもう1回、お願いします！！", "zh": "是、是！对不起！再来1遍，拜托了！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0184_1004_p", "source_sha256": "0197fdffe5f9f7ec0c023df3a12dd629e70f170c907dc12f9fd4a86e30e48a5c", "ja": "（何度目かのリテイク……噂どおり、厳しい監督だな。\n次の休憩で、可奈の様子を見ておかないと）", "zh": "（这是第几次重拍了……正如传闻所说，真是位严格的导演。下次休息时，得去看看可奈的情况。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0184_1005_p", "source_sha256": "12eb5c6dba2dc0210cd5171ac8b63efb714adc24af306481526d22cb1ffd7f77", "ja": "可奈、お疲れさま。\nちょっと話があるんだけど……大丈夫か？", "zh": "可奈，辛苦了。\n我有点事想和你谈谈……可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0184_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "75620cf4cef36a585be91f3a227b20e6c3297282ba1b1f757a4928985928e71e", "ja": "はれっ？　{$P$}さんもですか？\n私もちょうど、話したいことがあったんですよー！", "zh": "咦？{$P$}先生也是吗？\n我正好也有想说的事呢——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0184_1007_p", "source_sha256": "05212642ebce63c36aecba9f1bd747dee196de0a9b2c054512a435358fc0ff5f", "ja": "可奈も？　……やっぱりそうか。\nなら、可奈の話を先に聞いた方が良さそうだな。", "zh": "可奈也是吗？……果然如此啊。\n既然这样，那还是先听你说比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0184_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "d5f2287fab3a6917cada1a5e955dadfbee425894bfd62d96285de076c5f4bfdc", "ja": "私からでいいんですか？\nそれじゃあ……。", "zh": "真的可以先听我说吗？\n那……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0184_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "3b1e7b735763ab4d359833430ad8dee7028248a0fab957c36bcf8ec6cf1d443c", "ja": "{$P$}さん～♪\n太陽みたいにさんさん～♪　元気になあれ～♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生～♪\n像太阳一样灿烂～♪　打起精神来吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0184_1010_p", "source_sha256": "77da3b80953d0384d399fae45e2c2bf3eb96ddbf8c7cea06ef15e9beff96a270", "ja": "え？　……可奈、今のは……。", "zh": "咦？……可奈，刚才那是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0184_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "b707cb8adbba3f78e17f51327c24095e4d78769db28586f2f23c123838792075", "ja": "元気が出る、おまじないです！\n{$P$}さん、元気出ましたかっ？", "zh": "这是能让人打起精神的咒语！\n{$P$}先生，打起精神了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0184_1012_p", "source_sha256": "2b63695c060862aa5a91d465f37d69ae5a6f26b41564bc89eb56b40c72174c6f", "ja": "元気……いや、俺よりも大変なのは可奈だろ？\nさっきからリテイクが多いし……。", "zh": "精神……不，应该是可奈比我更辛苦吧？\n从刚才开始重拍就很多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0184_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "629d912f15517da55fc2fa5eff00e704a97a3acb436c3c6a8a95a531c94a3071", "ja": "え？　たしかに、ちょっと大変ですけど……。\nなかなか、オッケーもらえませんし。", "zh": "诶？确实是有点辛苦……  \n毕竟一直都没能得到认可。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0184_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "3a690bb184c7905090c47574d05d93b27e5a41cf9b234fd49eae8aa741175dbe", "ja": "でもでも、監督さん、私のために、すっごく\nいろんなこと考えてくれてるんですよ！", "zh": "不过不过，导演先生为了我，真的考虑了好多好多事情呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0184_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "47fbb9ae874f4965929aa5d83deebd78418df52c004d4fbf0502a90debcee561", "ja": "自分でも、ちょっとずつ良くなってるのわかるんです！\nあっぷあっぷだけど～♪　レベルもアップ～♪", "zh": "我自己也能感觉到，正在一点点变好！\n虽然还手忙脚乱的～♪ 但等级也提升啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0184_1016_p", "source_sha256": "96947bc42ccf9fdae9c9889942940c41bf43b6c353bc6f3386a251c4c4207311", "ja": "そうか……それなら、安心だ。\n最後まで頑張れそうか？", "zh": "这样啊……那我就放心了。\n你能坚持到最后吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0184_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "3ce2371bfb7e8338163d92675aa293af960356f90a5b76d08ce0ad584dec681e", "ja": "はいっ！　それに、私より\n{$P$}さんが気になっちゃって……。", "zh": "是的！而且，我更担心{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0184_1018_036kan", "source_sha256": "1c5e9532d9e4e240b06e2cdeb4f956a4d08b002162770754491cd746662fb644", "ja": "なんだか元気なさそうだったから、\n私の歌で励ましたいな～って思ってました！", "zh": "因为感觉您好像没什么精神，所以我一直想着，要用我的歌为您打气～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0184_1019_p", "source_sha256": "1aaaaf6763a23c8cafa211114a60c13783dd82b6b2e1a7abf229dfcc5e81abe3", "ja": "いや、それならもう大丈夫。可奈の歌で、\nすごく元気になったよ。ありがとう！", "zh": "不，已经没事了。听了可奈的歌，我已经精神多了。谢谢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0184_1020_036kan", "source_sha256": "93333608022f3adce2036abcd99de098d793b1e703b829b592250d96ad374571", "ja": "わあ、よかった！　取り戻せたぞ元気～♪\nそしたら現場に復帰～♪", "zh": "哇，太好啦！精神已经恢复啦～♪\n那就重返拍摄现场～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0184_1021_036kan", "source_sha256": "6d58f026f4d23e352708660ce0b82f2bd26eadbe61b1a48c4ac5b36f130f43a8", "ja": "あっ、そろそろ、撮影再開ですね！　行きましょう、\n{$P$}さん！　ゴーゴー♪", "zh": "啊，差不多该重新开始拍摄了！我们走吧，{$P$}先生！冲呀冲呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0184_1022_p", "source_sha256": "f142dd8160409ed5c310e008f10863ec509f1e1b0df122816ec7ac1200bdb3ea", "ja": "（心配してるようで、心配されていたとは……。\nこんな成長も、これからは見守っていかないとな！）", "zh": "（明明看起来是在担心别人，没想到自己却被担心了……今后也得好好守望着这样的成长才行啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
